      "facts": [
        "Whether Postgres keeps a mirror of the Convex `daytona_migration` sidecar (each project's Daytona server and sandbox migration state; Postgres table of the same name). COD-742 sandboxes; runbook in docs/freebuff-sandbox-errors-postgres.md, \"Migration sidecar\".",
